<title>USA: Consolidated Nevada names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Nevada names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Nevada Goldfields Corp said on Monday that Alex Bissett has been appointed president and chief executive officer, replacing Geoffrey Hoyl.</p>
<p>Previously, Bissett was president of Pincock, Allen &amp; Holt, an internationally recognized mineral-resource consulting and engineering firm, the company said.</p>
